<p>President Donald Trump hosted a Black History Month reception at the White House, using the event to promote his record and project support as race-related controversies again draw scrutiny, according to coverage.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/Npfdy6lclaC-vl03MFTZxl6xwq_CtA-XMbiNAXnVOovLfDViHdqK6bt4J_8-wJTO7K0sjBYGWGSocCms2gTP_sIBIgBp_Z88s2AVxCQQv3-3aoU9mqEDOOlAWnheuoso_0UXAt1LAYembhzi_1VmUyWJA_hPpVYI9WACQ-eFfdHzKgZNC_z8E-oXwmQBeqv_D68BKWI' alt='President Donald Trump at a White House Black History Month reception.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Supporter shout-outs: Trump name-checked supporters including Mike Tyson and Nicki Minaj, and praised Tyson for defending him against accusations of racism.</li><li>Promise made: At the Black History Month event, Trump promised “a century more” of success for African Americans, according to one account.</li><li>Dhillon praise: Trump praised Harmeet Kaur Dhillon at the White House reception, and coverage linked the mention to a Harvard-related case.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>NDTV (reporting): It said Trump used the reception to highlight his record on criminal justice reform, the economy, and public safety. (<a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/trump-praises-indian-american-harmeet-dhillon-at-white-house-event-11056520#publisher=newsstand'>NDTV</a>)</li><li>The Straits Times (reporting/analysis): It described Trump as soaking up Black History Month praise while trying to dodge or rebut claims of racism. (<a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/united-states/trump-basks-in-black-history-month-praise-dodging-racism-claims'>The Straits Times</a>)</li><li>The Hindu (reporting): It highlighted the timing of the reception, coming weeks after backlash over a racist post. (<a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/trump-hosts-black-history-month-reception-weeks-after-backlash-over-backlash-over-racist-post/article70650159.ece'>The Hindu</a>)</li><li>Reddit users (discussion): Posts and comments debated what it means when Black allies praise Trump after a video described as depicting the Obamas as apes, reflecting polarized reactions online. (<a href='https://www.reddit.com/r/inthenews/comments/1r8ld4m/black_allies_praise_trump_weeks-after_video/'>Reddit</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.reddit.com/r/inthenews/comments/1r8ld4m/black_allies_praise_trump_weeks_after_video/'>Black allies praise Trump weeks after video depicting Obamas as apes</a> - reddit.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/united-states/trump-basks-in-black-history-month-praise-dodging-racism-claims'>Trump basks in Black History Month praise, dodging racism claims</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/trump-praises-indian-american-harmeet-dhillon-at-white-house-event-11056520#publisher=newsstand'>Trump Praises Indian American Harmeet Dhillon Amid Harvard Case</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/trump-hosts-black-history-month-reception-weeks-after-backlash-over-racist-post/article70650159.ece'>Trump hosts Black History Month reception, weeks after backlash over racist post</a> - thehindu.com</li></ul>